perturb the variable-bits quantization scale constant
quaternion[order[0]] * 0.7071067811865476 * quantization_limit
----
quaternion[order[0]] * 0.7071068 * quantization_limit
====
round the 13-bit quantization multiplier
quaternion[order[0]] * 5791.911644699011
----
quaternion[order[0]] * 5792.0
====
quantization limit off by one
(1 << (bits - 1)) - 1.0
----
(1 << bits) - 1.0
====
drop the quantization scale from the first encoded slot
out[1] = (int32_t)(quaternion[order[0]] * 0.7071067811865476 * quantization_limit);
----
out[1] = (int32_t)quaternion[order[0]];
====
